---
---

<!-- Section Garanteed Trust & Authority: Added to Every Page -->
<section class="w-full py-16 bg-surface-container-low border-t border-primary/10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-primary font-bold text-xs mb-2">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container text-[18px]">verified_user</span>
        <span>Vos Garanties Légales & Professionnelles à Mons</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-headline-xl text-2xl md:text-3xl text-primary font-extrabold tracking-tight">
        Pourquoi Choisir Plombier Mons Urgent en Toute Confiance ?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-2 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Toutes les certifications belges, assurance décennale complète, plus de 15 ans d'expérience sur le terrain et engagement d'intervention en 30 à 45 minutes chrono.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 5 Core Pillars Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
      <!-- 1. Response Time Promises -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest border border-primary/10 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-primary-container/40 transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-tertiary-fixed text-tertiary-container flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">timer</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-extrabold text-tertiary-container">Délai d'Urgence</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-base text-primary font-bold mt-1">30 à 45 Min Chrono</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Arrivée garantie en 30-45 minutes à Mons et tout le Borinage. Permanence active <strong>24h/24 & 7j/7</strong>, dimanches et fériés. Rappel en moins de 15 min.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-3 mt-3 border-t border-primary/5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-bold text-primary-container">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">check</span>
          <span>Dépannage 24/7/365</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Years in Business -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest border border-primary/10 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-primary-container/40 transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary-container/10 text-primary-container flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">history</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-extrabold text-primary-container">Expérience Locale</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-base text-primary font-bold mt-1">15+ Ans de Métier</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Établis depuis 2011 à Mons. Plus de <strong>12 500 dépannages</strong> réussis et une note certifiée de 4.9/5 sur Google (+180 avis clients locaux).
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-3 mt-3 border-t border-primary/5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-bold text-primary-container">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">star</span>
          <span>4.9 / 5 Google Reviews</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. All Certifications -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest border border-primary/10 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-primary-container/40 transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary-container/10 text-primary-container flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">verified</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-extrabold text-primary-container">Labels & Agréments</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-base text-primary font-bold mt-1">Toutes Certifications</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Habilité <strong>CERGA Gaz</strong>, Technicien agréé <strong>Wallonie G1/G2</strong>, affilié CSTC, installateur partenaire Geberit, Grohe & Durlem. BCE BE 0842.195.834.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-3 mt-3 border-t border-primary/5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-bold text-primary-container">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">military_tech</span>
          <span>Agréé CERGA & Wallonie</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Insurance Information -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest border border-primary/10 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-primary-container/40 transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary-container/10 text-primary-container flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">policy</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-extrabold text-primary-container">Assurances Belges</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-base text-primary font-bold mt-1">RC Pro & Décennale</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Police d'assurance RC Professionnelle & Décennale (Ethias / AXA). <strong>Rapport technique officiel</strong> remis sous 24h pour remboursement intégral du sinistre.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-3 mt-3 border-t border-primary/5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-bold text-primary-container">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">receipt_long</span>
          <span>Agréé Ethias, AXA, AG</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 5. Service Guarantees -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest border border-primary/10 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-primary-container/40 transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary-container/10 text-primary-container flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">gavel</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-extrabold text-primary-container">Garanties Fermes</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-base text-primary font-bold mt-1">Garantie 2 à 10 Ans</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Garantie 2 ans pièces & main-d'œuvre, garantie 10 ans étanchéité/tuyauteries. <strong>Devis écrit préalable</strong> signé sans supplément. TVA 6 % logements &gt; 10 ans.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-3 mt-3 border-t border-primary/5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-bold text-primary-container">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">price_check</span>
          <span>Devis clair + TVA 6%</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Reassurance strip logos / Badges text -->
    <div class="mt-8 p-4 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest border border-primary/10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-around gap-4 text-xs font-semibold text-primary">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container text-[18px]">verified</span>
        <span>Agréé CERGA Gaz Naturel</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container text-[18px]">workspace_premium</span>
        <span>Habilité Région Wallonne G1/G2</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container text-[18px]">shield</span>
        <span>RC Pro AXA / Ethias n° BE-RC-8942-01</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container text-[18px]">percent</span>
        <span>Taux Réduit TVA 6% (Habitation &gt; 10 ans)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container text-[18px]">alarm_on</span>
        <span>Arrivée Garantie 30–45 min</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
